\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {I}{\ignorespaces Matched complete native (N) and domain-first (D) attempts. Wire/SB/CB are actual occupancy; endpoints are setup improvements/regressions and increased hold violations versus each arm's own root. Balanced BNN rows give two-repeat mean time and maximum sampled tree PSS in GiB. SB-only/CB-only and the 102\% budget are explicit configuration variants, not new circuits. Failures, timeouts and unadmitted confirmation have measured attempt costs but no admitted quality; these costs are not successful algorithm-time comparisons. Both LSTM roles have supplementary full quality admission. Their original verification failures and audit costs remain supplementary; D includes external archival interference, so its raw full cost supports no clean overhead ratio. BNN cold rows, earlier variants and scoped controls are supplementary. TPU-OS and CLSTM-SB are single N/D observations, not interleaved timing.}}{4}{}\protected@file@percent }
